// E1103: three tables share an `id`; the second and the third are reported, one each at their `id` value, and the
// first, written earliest, is not (§15.3 `id` row, §14.3, §18.1; S-580).

@export
pub flow voice(x: F32 at sample) -> F32 at sample { x }
